then it's never going to be Ena or ENENB or even END behaviour.

00:22:14.040 --> 00:22:16.320
So then what can you do? You need to use folding lines.

00:22:16.320 --> 00:22:19.600
So this is like a, an extra set of line that you connect to the

00:22:19.600 --> 00:22:23.320
leading edge that allows you to kind of like destroy the airfoil

00:22:23.320 --> 00:22:26.440
and collapse it anyway and study what happens if you do get a

00:22:26.440 --> 00:22:29.360
