00:41:01.160 --> 00:41:04.800
And projected aspect ratio is not even objectively defined

00:41:05.120 --> 00:41:07.960
because your glider deforms, it doesn't have the same shape if

00:41:07.960 --> 00:41:09.880
you're full speed, trim speed over with brakes.

00:41:10.160 --> 00:41:14.520
So the there is no objective definition for projected aspect

00:41:14.520 --> 00:41:19.200
ratio. Like I'm having to rewrite my

00:41:19.200 --> 00:41:22.720
