00:41:26.880 --> 00:41:31.800
But we can talk about the figure of 6.7 aspect ratio. 6.7 is more

00:41:31.800 --> 00:41:36.120
or less a sweet spot that a lot of people have come to consensus

00:41:36.120 --> 00:41:39.320
that this new CSC glider should be kept below it.

00:41:39.320 --> 00:41:43.200
So what happens beyond 6.7? Or how does aspect ratio make a

00:41:43.200 --> 00:41:47.160
nose? So we had kind of like 2-2 sub

00:41:47.160 --> 00:41:51.680
working groups and this discussion and we had two, two

00:41:51.680 --> 00:41:54.640
different ideas. So, so we worked together, sat

00:41:54.640 --> 00:42:01.240
down with Luke from Ozone, Hugo Shabu from Air Design and also

00:42:01.240 --> 00:42:04.720
