00:42:05.160 --> 00:42:09.160
And I think the outcome of our discussions was that the market

00:42:09.160 --> 00:42:14.120
is complicated enough and we would not be happy to have a

00:42:14.120 --> 00:42:17.560
split of like the C gliders for the C pilots and the C gliders

00:42:17.560 --> 00:42:21.040
for s s. And so we were thinking to have

00:42:21.040 --> 00:42:24.800
a more stringent limitation to avoid like racing Indian seas

00:42:24.800 --> 00:42:29.480
