00:42:32.560 --> 00:42:36.880
And so this is when we first thought about going down with

00:42:36.880 --> 00:42:39.880
the aspect ratio limitation. Instead of 6.7, we thought about

00:42:39.880 --> 00:42:46.400
6.2 or something in that ballpark, which was contested or

00:42:47.000 --> 00:42:52.000
