00:42:52.000 --> 00:42:55.880
limitation of 66 cells because then 66 cells give you a lot of

00:42:55.880 --> 00:42:59.000
freedom. You can have a 7 to 1 aspect

00:42:59.000 --> 00:43:01.920
ratio if you want, but that's not going to be optimal.

00:43:02.360 --> 00:43:06.560
And using 66 cells is because we think that the optimal aspect

00:43:06.560 --> 00:43:13.280
ratio for 66 will be around between 6.3 and 6.4 or 6.5.

00:43:14.200 --> 00:43:20.600
And this to us sounded like a more reasonable limitation for

00:43:20.600 --> 00:43:23.600
this category. And the other parameter was that

00:43:23.840 --> 00:43:26.960
using a cell limitation and other flat aspect limitation

00:43:27.360 --> 00:43:31.280
means that you have the freedom if you want to put a bit more

00:43:31.280 --> 00:43:35.160
