00:43:35.160 --> 00:43:36.840
best behaviour and the best feel.

00:43:37.320 --> 00:43:40.120
If you limit the flat aspect ratio, then you don't want to go

00:43:40.120 --> 00:43:42.840
with too much arc because then you don't want to lose this

00:43:42.840 --> 00:43:45.320
